      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "OverlayFS",
      "source_hash": 11890966129797980496,
      "context_hash": 18443130020488327514,
      "translation": "OverlayFS",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319941Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Union mounts for container image layers.",
      "source_hash": 16553192493576946042,
      "context_hash": 4762195010458988523,
      "translation": "컨테이너 이미지 레이어를 위한 유니언 마운트(union mount)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319942Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Written by Miklos Szeredi at SUSE and merged in Linux 3.18 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/e9be9d5e76e34872f0c37d72e25bc27fe9e2c54c) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/618140/).",
      "source_hash": 1251561554075086378,
      "context_hash": 6533194231461532864,
      "translation": "SUSE의 Miklos Szeredi가 작성했으며 Linux 3.18에 병합되었습니다 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/e9be9d5e76e34872f0c37d72e25bc27fe9e2c54c) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/618140/).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319943Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What OverlayFS does",
      "source_hash": 12416603468595723171,
      "context_hash": 3834618891156763311,
      "translation": "OverlayFS가 하는 일",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319943Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "OverlayFS presents a merged view of two or more directory trees:",
      "source_hash": 8705445535685075913,
      "context_hash": 3965943936211489033,
      "translation": "OverlayFS는 둘 이상의 디렉터리 트리를 병합한 뷰를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319943Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Mounting OverlayFS",
      "source_hash": 3603167268870259970,
      "context_hash": 12888836481530410389,
      "translation": "OverlayFS 마운트하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319943Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Copy-on-write (copy-up)",
      "source_hash": 3395277463608417737,
      "context_hash": 11084566305630459182,
      "translation": "copy-on-write(copy-up)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-on-write": "copy-on-write",
        "copy-up": "copy-up"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a container writes to a file from a lower layer, OverlayFS:",
      "source_hash": 7005622335513750838,
      "context_hash": 14141541994845744492,
      "translation": "컨테이너가 하위 레이어의 파일에 쓰기를 수행하면 OverlayFS는 다음과 같이 동작합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Copies the file from lower to upper (copy-up)",
      "source_hash": 13134250302742908264,
      "context_hash": 12643181729715228194,
      "translation": "파일을 lower에서 upper로 복사(copy-up)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-up": "copy-up"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Applies the write to the copy in upper",
      "source_hash": 5277836693080481203,
      "context_hash": 18367853037413378218,
      "translation": "upper에 있는 복사본에 쓰기 적용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Future reads see the upper copy",
      "source_hash": 8451032966329059145,
      "context_hash": 6907400657565956747,
      "translation": "이후의 읽기는 upper의 복사본을 참조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Copy-up in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 3906365766138922293,
      "context_hash": 4408034150290536155,
      "translation": "커널에서의 copy-up",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-up": "copy-up",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Copy-up is atomic: the kernel writes to a temp file in `workdir`, then `rename()`s it to the final location in `upper`.",
      "source_hash": 12201176538219027780,
      "context_hash": 16496910945431884579,
      "translation": "copy-up은 원자적입니다: 커널은 `workdir`에 있는 임시 파일에 쓴 다음, 이를 `upper` 안의 최종 위치로 `rename()`합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-up": "copy-up",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "If interrupted, no partial file is visible.",
      "source_hash": 9096328746288140715,
      "context_hash": 11941134800771402924,
      "translation": "중간에 중단되더라도 불완전한 파일은 보이지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Whiteout files",
      "source_hash": 13632116418848979646,
      "context_hash": 11452424835824791090,
      "translation": "whiteout 파일",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a container *deletes* a file from the lower layer, OverlayFS creates a **whiteout** entry in upper — a special file that marks the file as deleted:",
      "source_hash": 885806762587728177,
      "context_hash": 13226838755311898418,
      "translation": "컨테이너가 하위 레이어의 파일을 *삭제*하면, OverlayFS는 upper에 **whiteout** 항목을 생성합니다 — 이는 해당 파일이 삭제되었음을 표시하는 특수 파일입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Opaque directories",
      "source_hash": 10344468312074439675,
      "context_hash": 621324158951629369,
      "translation": "opaque 디렉터리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "When a container deletes a directory and recreates it (or if a copy-up of a directory occurs), OverlayFS marks the upper directory as **opaque** — lower directory contents are hidden:",
      "source_hash": 12262014360842365089,
      "context_hash": 2705307028743235624,
      "translation": "컨테이너가 디렉터리를 삭제한 뒤 다시 생성하면(또는 디렉터리의 copy-up이 발생하면), OverlayFS는 upper 디렉터리를 **opaque**로 표시합니다 — 하위 디렉터리의 내용은 가려집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-up": "copy-up"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Metacopy optimization",
      "source_hash": 15274010480886531245,
      "context_hash": 14080536107135268459,
      "translation": "metacopy 최적화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Metacopy** (`metacopy=on`) defers data copy-up until actual data write.",
      "source_hash": 5933308770934753269,
      "context_hash": 15176261490189901441,
      "translation": "**metacopy**(`metacopy=on`)는 데이터의 copy-up을 실제 데이터 쓰기가 일어날 때까지 미룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-up": "copy-up"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Metadata changes (chmod, chown, xattr) only copy metadata, leaving data in lower:",
      "source_hash": 5244150242648328504,
      "context_hash": 16625704950817735344,
      "translation": "메타데이터 변경(chmod, chown, xattr)은 메타데이터만 복사하고 데이터는 lower에 그대로 둡니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "metadata": "메타데이터",
        "xattr": "xattr"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This dramatically reduces copy-up cost for permission changes.",
      "source_hash": 4650018634343733543,
      "context_hash": 18312534794731983472,
      "translation": "이를 통해 권한 변경 시의 copy-up 비용이 극적으로 줄어듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-up": "copy-up"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Docker's overlay2 driver",
      "source_hash": 7794704705730376997,
      "context_hash": 16875814523006346838,
      "translation": "Docker의 overlay2 드라이버",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Docker uses OverlayFS as its default storage driver (`overlay2`) — replacing AUFS as the default for most Linux distributions:",
      "source_hash": 182565788399143673,
      "context_hash": 2661609348346817889,
      "translation": "Docker는 OverlayFS를 기본 스토리지 드라이버(`overlay2`)로 사용합니다 — 대부분의 Linux 배포판에서 AUFS를 대체하여 기본값이 되었습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Layer sharing",
      "source_hash": 1223310568931524966,
      "context_hash": 17953800049911118853,
      "translation": "레이어 공유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The power of OverlayFS for containers: multiple containers with the same base image share the lower layers:",
      "source_hash": 2458387079642340489,
      "context_hash": 9256130323483478071,
      "translation": "컨테이너에서 OverlayFS가 갖는 강점은 동일한 베이스 이미지를 사용하는 여러 컨테이너가 하위 레이어를 공유한다는 점입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Changes in Container A don't affect Container B — each has its own upper layer.",
      "source_hash": 11225631906847652270,
      "context_hash": 3510637459550172549,
      "translation": "컨테이너 A의 변경은 컨테이너 B에 영향을 주지 않습니다 — 각 컨테이너는 자신만의 upper 레이어를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:13.319946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
